; THE PLAYER. Everything about how he moves is on this node -- open it and
; change the numbers. JUMP is metres per second at takeoff; the height you
; clear is JUMP^2 / (2 * GRAVITY), so 6.5 against 12 is about 1.76 m.
; It was 4.2, which is 0.73 m, and that is why jumping felt like nothing.

